[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3303.43, "timestamp": "00:55:03", "text": "蘇基亞是最棒的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3310.67, "timestamp": "00:55:10", "text": "我真心想說。  至於咖哩，日式咖哩其實就是森巴湯，如果你知道森巴湯是什麼的話。  如果你來自南印度之類的地區，或者我想北印度人也一樣，他們都會吃桑巴爾。  嗯，它基本上有點像桑巴湯，但沒有那麼辣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3321.27, "timestamp": "00:55:21", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3324.153, "timestamp": "00:55:24", "text": "很甜。這裡的人喜歡淘寶，喜歡甜食。所以，我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3331.19, "timestamp": "00:55:31", "text": "有像咖哩一樣的東西，你可以在超市買到咖哩，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3333.19, "timestamp": "00:55:33", "text": "五級辣度，我們有六級最辣版本，但它一點也不辣，夥計。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3345.522, "timestamp": "00:55:45", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": " U have no idea I like going out a lot I have tried a lot of stuff in India "}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3351.085, "timestamp": "00:55:51", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Like If i"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3358.07, "timestamp": "00:55:58", "text": "你要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3359.75, "timestamp": "00:55:59", "text": "來"}]